### Ranking (top 5 by positive-review rate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ranking?limit=5

### All albums with stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/stats

### Album detail: tracks, average rating, positive rate
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2

### Reviews for an album, with usernames
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2/reviews
